window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I swore an oath to destroy them.</p> <p>I failed.</p> <p>Not only did I fail, I am left flailing before the gods as an oathbreaker. Now, the beings I swore to destroy, are my most treasured. My loved ones. My beloved companions and the future mothers to my children.</p> <p>If not for those damn tiephlings...</p> <p>And maybe when I finish with them, I'll take my fight to the very gods themselves.</p>"; 
